{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56258","headline":"复爲翰林作（题拟） · 欧阳彬","name":"复爲翰林作（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年追感泪横流，今日寻悲是漫愁。\n容易得来容易失，等闲成了等闲休。\n皇图本谓儿孙置，白刃番成骨肉讐。\n梁汉後唐三世主，九泉相见大悠悠。\n（见《类说》卷十九李畋《该闻录》。\n）（〖1〗《该闻录》：「欧阳彬三蜀时爲翰林学士，唐明宗时入洛，责令归蜀。\n孟氏开国，复爲翰林，作诗云〖略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}